  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting access to Justice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project objective : Enhance the protection of the victims of human rights violations and enable victims of torture (VoT) to durably reintegrate into their communities and positively contribute to the Lebanese society.

Outcome 1 : Victims of Torture and their relatives have increased access to rehabilitation and legal services at the bar association in Tripoli 
Outcome 2 : A Human Rights Monitoring Center within the Tripoli Bar Association is established   

Target Group: the target group is every person in Lebanon who can be classified as victim of torture as defined in the &#x201c;Convention against Torture and Other Cruel, Inhuman or Degrading Treatment or Punishment&#x201d;)</narrative>
  </description>
